[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":109},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-295":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},295,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-295","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Dartmouth College\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-usa\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-USA\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United States of America (USA)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Laptop\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: November 1 Every Year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Now let’s talk briefly about the Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The King Scholar Program prepares today’s young scholars from developing countries to be tomorrow’s leaders in alleviating global poverty.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The King Scholars Program seeks low-income students from developing nations who are interested in alleviating poverty in their home countries. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dartmouth College King Scholars Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>King Scholars receive 4-year scholarships and extensive mentoring and leadership training.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upon graduation, they return home to tackle poverty issues, supported by Dartmouth’s alumni network.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>King Scholars attend Dartmouth for four years at no cost to students or their families.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>This includes health insurance, a new computer in the first year, and annual travel between Dartmouth and the student’s home country.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>King Scholars receive pre-orientation support and mentoring services to help with the transition to college and ongoing academic mentoring throughout their Dartmouth careers. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Dartmouth College King Scholarship aims to benefit students who are:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Involved in their communities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Passionate about creating positive change\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Interested in alleviating poverty in their own countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Capable of succeeding at a top U.S. university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Driven to succeed in whatever they do\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proficient in English\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for Dartmouth College King Scholars Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Dartmouth College King Scholars Program 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English Language Proficiency \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> Click on the button below to visit the scholarship webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on “\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmissions.dartmouth.edu\u002Fapply\u002Fapply-dartmouth#filter-1446\">Apply to Dartmouth\u003C\u002Fa>“\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on ‘\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmissions.dartmouth.edu\u002Fglossary-term\u002Fapplication\">Apply Now\u003C\u002Fa>‘\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on ‘\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmissions.dartmouth.edu\u002Fglossary-term\u002Fapplication\">Early Admission Decision\u003C\u002Fa>“\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proceed with your application using the ‘\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fapply.commonapp.org\u002Flogin?ma=74\">Common App\u003C\u002Fa>‘ \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create your Common App Account\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill in your personal details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proceed to upload all required documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: November 1, Every Year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstudents.dartmouth.edu\u002Fking-scholars\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fstudents.dartmouth.edu\u002Fking-scholars\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-17 15:15:54",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a32ac1a0044e3.66262713_screenshot 2026-06-17 151101.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a32ac1a0044e3.66262713_screenshot%202026-06-17%20151101.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,56,65,74,83,92,100],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":7,"images":31,"datePosted":35,"authorName":36},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity",[32],{"fileName":33,"oldFileName":33,"type":18,"file":19,"url":34},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95